  "details": "A minor accessibility annoyance.\n\nAffected URL: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202642-open-beta\n\n\"Live Now Overhaul\", \"Public Instance Ownership\", \"Updated Here Menu\", \"Color Palettes Update\", \"World Upvotes\" and \"Analog Arm\" are `<p>` and `<strong>`, when those should actually be `<h3>`.\n\nSee:\n\n- https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Techniques/general/G115.html\n\n- https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Techniques/html/H42",
